{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-3654479","kind":"blog","title":"【日记】2016皇居月光浴","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-05-24","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 皇居で月光浴！","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-3654479/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"走进平日少有机会到访的千代田区观光协会，在皇居与美丽月色相伴，和大家一起享受月光浴。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","日記"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 皇居で月光浴！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3654479.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160527051436id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3654479.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">因为工作的关系</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">似乎很少有机会前往的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">千代田区观光协会！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/001-f82e9f0e70.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/001-f82e9f0e70.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今天听取了会长森川先生的\n介绍，\n还一起吃了顿饭！\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">从协会里面还能看到绝美的景色！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/002-12b84c4364.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/002-12b84c4364.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"346\"></a></figure>\n\n点击放大↑\n\n<br>\n\n\n眼前就是皇居！\n右边是日本武道馆！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n听说这里是离护城河最近的地方・・\n要是掉下去，\n        <br>\n\n\n以这样的高度和构造・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n还是不太敢靠近（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n那里出现了一轮无比美丽的月亮！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n难得有这样的机会，\n大家一起合影留念（笑）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/003-dec3ee2282.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/003-dec3ee2282.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n大家全都是了不起的人！后面还有一轮大月亮！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在皇居这个不可思议的空间里，\n出现了一轮美得不可思议的月亮，\n整个人都被这股力量充满了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/004-df395cc721.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/004-df395cc721.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n总觉得真是度过了一段特别美好的时光！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/005-f725b49505.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/005-f725b49505.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家一起晒月光！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附带一提）\n这个好久没见到了！\n真是风雅啊！\n\n<br>\n\n\n蚊香！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/006-f1e82e9e65.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/006-f1e82e9e65.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"563\" height=\"732\"></a></figure></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">仕事柄</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">なかなか行くことは無さそうな</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">千代田区観光協会！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/001-f82e9f0e70.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/001-f82e9f0e70.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今日は会長の森川さんから\nお話を伺い\n食事をする会でした！\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">協会内からは素晴らしい景色が！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/002-12b84c4364.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/002-12b84c4364.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"346\"></a></figure>\n\nクリックで拡大↑\n\n<br>\n\n\n目の前は皇居！\n右には日本武道館！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nお堀に一番近い場所らしいのだけど・・\n落ちると\n        <br>\n\n\n登れないであろう高さと作り・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\nあまり近づけない（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそこに何とも美しい月が登場！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nせっかくなので\nみんなで記念撮影（笑）\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/003-dec3ee2282.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/003-dec3ee2282.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\nみなさん凄い方ばかり！後ろに大きな月が！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n皇居という不思議な空間に\n不思議なほど美しい月が現れて\nパワーに満たされました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/004-df395cc721.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/004-df395cc721.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n何だかとってもいい時間でしたよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/005-f725b49505.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/005-f725b49505.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nみんなで月光浴！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（オマケ）\nこれ久しぶりに見たよ！\n風流だよね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n蚊取り線香！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/006-f1e82e9e65.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3654479/006-f1e82e9e65.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"563\" height=\"732\"></a></figure></div>"}}